{"id": "h2-1C-02", "topic": "1C", "stem": "During meiosis, what process can create new combinations of alleles between linked genes, altering gamete genotypes and increasing genetic diversity?", "options": ["genetic drift", "selection", "mutation", "recombination"], "answer": "recombination", "source_id": "71479ebe-e682-4230-beab-d458bc170fe1", "source_span": {"chunk_id": "71479ebe-e682-4230-beab-d458bc170fe1#0-831", "start": 330, "end": 343, "quote": "recombination", "block_id": null, "url": "https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/12-3-laws-of-inheritance"}, "citation": "71479ebe-e682-4230-beab-d458bc170fe1[330:343] https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/12-3-laws-of-inheritance", "generator": "openai", "model": "gpt-5-2025-08-07", "attempt_id": "36c83a308a3c", "target_concept": "Synapsis or crossing-over mechanism for increasing genetic diversity", "question_type": "a mechanism question - what happens at a specific step, or what causes what", "prompt_sha256": "06feb19ebb584fa8e427ca0d588243e5de950b98dd103a78b327b60216fc1f05", "generated_at": "2026-08-02T19:22:23Z", "status": "live"}
